  "historyNote": "#1708, eff 4-3-81; ss by #2175, eff 11-30-82; amd by #2342, eff 4-21-83; ss by #2860, eff 9-24-84, EXPIRED 9-24-90 New. #4957, eff 10-19-90; ss by #6272, eff 6-25-96, EXPIRED: 6-25-04 New. #8143, eff 8-24-04; ss by #8912, eff 6-20-07, EXPIRED: 6-20-15 New. #12475, INTERIM, eff 2-2-18, EXPIRES: 8-1-18; ss by #12555, eff 6-21-18",
